*Input*font:            courier-12
*output*background:     #eef4f3
*output*foreground:     #1e2b2a
*output*font:           courier-12
*Output*background:     #eef4f3
*Output*foreground:     #1e2b2a
*Output*font:           courier-12
*text*background:       #eef4f3
*text*foreground:       #1e2b2a
*text*font:             courier-12
*Text*background:       #eef4f3
*Text*foreground:       #1e2b2a
*Text*font:             courier-12
*Text_Display*background: #eef4f3
*Text_Display*foreground: #1e2b2a
